{"title":"bruise violet, virgo iii","link":"https://keningzhu.com/journal/virgo-iii-bruise-violet","date":1758565904000,"content":"<figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/38f9e097-6c14-47af-81be-f20797743193/virgo3.png?format=1000w\" width=\"3840\" height=\"2160\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/38f9e097-6c14-47af-81be-f20797743193/virgo3.png?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/38f9e097-6c14-47af-81be-f20797743193/virgo3.png?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/38f9e097-6c14-47af-81be-f20797743193/virgo3.png?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/38f9e097-6c14-47af-81be-f20797743193/virgo3.png?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/38f9e097-6c14-47af-81be-f20797743193/virgo3.png?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/38f9e097-6c14-47af-81be-f20797743193/virgo3.png?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/38f9e097-6c14-47af-81be-f20797743193/virgo3.png?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n \n\n\n  <p><em>an illustration inspired by my collaboration with LJ of </em><a href=\"https://www.ceremony-studio.co.uk/\" target=\"_blank\"><em>Ceremony</em></a><em> for their communal writing practice, </em><a href=\"https://www.ceremony-studio.co.uk/atmospheres\" target=\"_blank\"><em>Atmospheres</em></a><em>, guided by the 36 decans of the astrological year. </em></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n<hr />\n\n\n  <p><strong><em>Virgo III</em></strong><em> — 14 September - 22 September<br /></em><strong><em>Key themes from LJ</em></strong><em> — roses, funerary plants, secrets<br /></em><strong><em>before this: </em></strong><a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/virgo-ii-blackberrying\" target=\"_blank\"><em>boundaries of blackberries, virgo II</em></a><em> <br /><br />*</em></p><p>I drew this rose in about 15 minutes, on the day of my fourth anniversary with my partner, in what’s been an unexpectedly hard season for me. roses speak to me of romance — a romance not necessarily with a person, but with the <em>idea</em> of romance itself. at the same time, they speak of grief; the boundary between pleasure and decay, of luxury and loss. behind every idea of romance is an ending — if not of a relationship, then of a season, or phase. this is what the end of summer/beginning of autumn feels like. </p><p>when I was sixteen years old, I wrote an essay response for some high school “this I believe” prompt — <em>“this I believe: that everything is ephemeral in this world, and it is a beautiful thing, that nothing last forever.”</em> <br /></p><p>looking back, I roll my eyes at my own dramatic nature, and, simultaneously, am impressed at my old-soul nature at sixteen — in being able to hold this truth, even though I’d struggle to embody it, in one way or another, for the next eighteen years… <br /><br />*</p><p>being with the energy of bruise violet — particularly during LJ’s ritual session — opened a doorway for me to think about the nature of change, symbolized by the sumptuousness of a rose. it helped me be with the different textures of grief. all great pleasures disappear, and we’re left with the memory of its fragrance, only held by the imagination. </p><p><strong><em><br />roses I drew before…</em></strong> </p><p><a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/a-brief-outline-of-roses\" target=\"_blank\">a brief outline of a rose</a> (2022)<br /><a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/a-morning-with-a-rose\" target=\"_blank\">morning with a rose</a> (2021)<br /><a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/a-night-with-a-rose\" target=\"_blank\">night with a rose</a> (2021)</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n<hr />\n\n\n  <h1>process</h1>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/174f2238-a65b-474d-898e-f57dfe494ec4/virgo_3_process.gif?format=1000w\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/174f2238-a65b-474d-898e-f57dfe494ec4/virgo_3_process.gif?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/174f2238-a65b-474d-898e-f57dfe494ec4/virgo_3_process.gif?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/174f2238-a65b-474d-898e-f57dfe494ec4/virgo_3_process.gif?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/174f2238-a65b-474d-898e-f57dfe494ec4/virgo_3_process.gif?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/174f2238-a65b-474d-898e-f57dfe494ec4/virgo_3_process.gif?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/174f2238-a65b-474d-898e-f57dfe494ec4/virgo_3_process.gif?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/174f2238-a65b-474d-898e-f57dfe494ec4/virgo_3_process.gif?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n<hr />\n\n\n  <p>explore <a href=\"https://www.ceremony-studio.co.uk/atmospheres\" target=\"_blank\">atmospheres</a><br />see all <a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal\" target=\"_blank\">atmospheres illustrations</a><br />more <a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/visual-art\" target=\"_blank\">visual art</a></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n ","author":"Kening Zhu","siteTitle":"kening zhu","siteHash":"ef8a94b9fc20c32a4ee7d94ee971337d278e8b2fafe747123e4eb5cea026e84e","entryHash":"d51ab762e7ebab51e32f3f8d8652adecb7b279f6f49e4aba94870a6813028814","category":"Sites"}